                    \\,.
          %p
            The statement is (
            %a{:href => "#CisinskiMoerdijk"}> Cisinski-Moerdijk, prop. 5.2
            ). The following proof proceeds in view of remark 5.3 there.
          .proof
            %h6#proof_8 Proof
            %p
              By prop.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#FibrationsInGenReedy"}
              we have that a morphism
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
