            %p
              To see that this is indeed Reedy fibrant, notice that this is so precisely if for all
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi k
                    %mo ∈
                    %mi ℕ
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} k \in \mathbb{N}
              the morphism
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
