                    \\,.
            %p
              Since the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/horn"} horn
              inclusions generate the acyclic monomorphisms, a morphism
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi X
                    %mo →
                    %mo *
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X \to *
              that has right lifting against this set also has right lifting against
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi Δ
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} [
                    %mn 0
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ]
                    %mo →
                    %mi Δ
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} [
                    %mi n
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ]
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mover
